# ── Layout tiers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# estate/ is the control plane. Everything with its own history or its own
# vendored upstream lives in a sibling tier and is NOT indexed here.
# Commit project work inside ranch/, control-plane work in this repo.

# project monorepo — own git repo, github.com/toxicwind/ranch
ranch/

# third-party checkouts (Hyprland, WhiteSur, ansible, ...) — own remotes
vendored/
# external projects with their own git remotes
projects/*
!projects/OmniRoute

# runtime state: archives, reconciliation snapshots, legacy, scratch
var/